{
	"_units": "Anti-armour rounds (wave 5, V2). Launchers (data/items.json, type launcher) fire these; a round item (type ammo) names its warhead in stats.warhead, a disposable launcher its own in stats.loaded. kind = Vehicle hit kind (heat, tandem_heat, he, hedp, thermobaric); calibre_mm = warhead diameter; penetration_mm = RHA a shaped-charge jet goes through (0 for none); blast_kg = TNT equivalent of the filling (overpressure and craters scale with its cube root); frag_m = how far its fragments wound, frag_wounds = [min, max] fragment wounds on a body close by; arming_m = it doesn't fuse closer than this (a dud); speed_mps = leaving the launcher; motor = a rocket motor that lights delay_s after launch and burns burn_s, taking the round to to_mps; max_s = after this many seconds of flight it self-destructs (self_destruct: the RPG-7's rounds) or is lost; mass_kg = the projectile in flight; guidance = '' (unguided, gravity), 'javelin' (locked target, top attack or direct), 'nlaw' (predicted line of sight, overfly top attack or direct). Javelin: cruise_mps, top_apex_m (highest climb, top attack), direct_apex_m, turn_dps. NLAW: ota_height_m above the line of sight, sensor_m below it. 40 mm grenades (the M320, Underbarrel): kind smoke (smoke_colour: the cloud it makes where it lands, SmokeCloud.COLOURS) instead of a burst; length_m = the round's length in flight (the drawn model; else by calibre); trail false = no smoke trail (no rocket motor). Combined arms A1 (docs/combined_arms.md 2.3): fuze = how it goes off on a vehicle plate (ArmourModel: none, pd with sensitivity_mm, pd_delay, piezo or tandem with graze_deg, proximity, airburst; data/shells.json describes them); rocket = an RPG-family or recoilless rocket (a slat cage shorts half of them); module_dmg = damage behind the plate on a full penetration (hp_kj units); spall = fragments behind it (phase A2); range_m on the ATGMs is for phase A3, which also gives them their guidance. All values are proposed, from the real 